Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.34,0:00:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(走过的路)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.61,0:00:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一条船上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.77,0:00:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你体内偷来的能量还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that, um, stolen grace inside you working out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是该隐的血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bloody mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这么强大的魔法是有代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic that powerful comes at a price,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在  我们还不知道这代价是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and right now we don't know what that price is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,把刀放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.01,0:00:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我一碰到那把刀...\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time I touched that blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.43,0:00:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道没人能阻止我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that I wouldn't be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始觉得那把刀还有其他的影响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to think the blade is doing something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,睁开你的双眼  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your eyes, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.93,0:01:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起对月长啸吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go take a howl at that moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.44,0:01:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到传言了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ard the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.17,0:01:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "No, that can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.69,0:01:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,温家人会变成我们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Winchester one of us?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.01,0:01:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是真的 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's true, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你曾经有怎样的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever soul you had,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:02:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你曾经坚守过怎样的信条\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever boy scout code you cuddled up to at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那些都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.01,0:02:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.23,0:02:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳利在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.16,0:02:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我再问一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳利在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-我哥哥在哪  -我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's my brother? - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那就叫个知道的人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're gonna call somebody who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.51,0:02:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都不回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-they won't answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.25,0:02:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-召唤他们  -我们有命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Make the call. - We're under orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,召唤他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the call!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我哥哥在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my brother?!
