Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,(四周后)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  那么没有明显的作物枯萎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, right. So, no noticeable crop failures,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.63,0:03:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没有大规模牲畜死亡  什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}no mass cattle deaths... nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.33,0:03:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  没有任何动静  没有什么新事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Nothing new on the radar. Nothing on the scope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say that's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了  说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, yeah, yeah, yeah. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了  麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I hear you, Mike. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.57,0:03:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这的确是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.77,0:03:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有什么异常情况及时通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, keep me posted if anything does pop up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好  自己保重  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, watch yourself, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.65,0:03:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I will. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,(萨姆  放手吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,(俄亥俄州失踪男子威斯康辛州被杀)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(萨姆来电)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I might've found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good.Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.43,0:05:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡  在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass? You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'm... I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.15,0:05:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,接着说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, go... go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.45,0:05:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,威斯康辛州一名一周前被杀的无名男子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A John Doe who was murdered in wisconsin a week ago
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是北俄亥俄州\N{\fnArial\fs30}turns out to be this guy named Drew Neely
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一个宗教团体的失踪成员  名叫德鲁·尼利\N{\fnArial\fs30}who went missing from some religious order in northern Ohio, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,德鲁·尼利已经失踪3年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Drew Neely has been missing for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他杀了妻子  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed his wife, his kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,随后人间蒸发\N{\fnArial\fs30}and...just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.31,0:05:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道线索不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's thin...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果这人是被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but if this guy was possessed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那么他就是第一个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that would make him the first...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,第一个线索  我们已经很久没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first lead, the first anything we've seen in...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那个  这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我又仔细看了看报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that I'm looking at this more,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I think I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.93,0:05:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,太心急了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I jumped the gun here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不  萨姆  你说是条线索的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam, you said it was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.69,0:05:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's... it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我想错了  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-我能帮忙  -小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can help. - Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  你不能把那个恶魔伤你肩的事怪在我头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you can't blame what that demon did to your shoulder on... on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.27,0:06:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-你当时...  -我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were out of... - I'm not, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有怪你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not blaming anything on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那事就是那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened...happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你该担心自己的健康了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to be worrying about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不该来打扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I really shouldn't have bothered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我挺好的  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good. I-I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.39,0:06:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是挺累的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just tired, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能把他找回来  我就会没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be better when we get him back...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我要先收拾他一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-after I kick his butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.90,0:06:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我好想他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么就那么一走了之呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he just disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,或许那不是他的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says he had a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那字条是谁写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then who wrote the note?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得可不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think there's any chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩可不可能还是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance at all that Dean is still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还是原来的那个迪恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still even remotely Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我性感得没法爱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm too sexy for my love, too sexy for my love. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 爱情要弃我而去了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Love's going to leave me. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我性感得衣服装不下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And I'm too sexy for my shirt, too sexy for my shirt. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 性感得疼 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So sexy it hurts. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 连米兰都被我性感得受不了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And I'm too sexy for Milan, too sexy for Milan. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 还有纽约和日本 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ New York and Japan. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.61,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-关掉吧  -下去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn if off! - Get off the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一起唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我又休息超时了  达瑞尔非杀了我不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darryl's gonna kill me if I'm late from my break again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.15,0:08:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你赶紧点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但你非得做那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then you had to go and do that thing with the...thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.23,0:08:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你求着我做的那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean that thing that you were begging me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.99,0:08:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是求你快点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begging you to hurry it up, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.43,0:08:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,做得那么爽就别再争论了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's not argue about good sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,的确很爽  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was good, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.45,0:08:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不过  别乐过头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh...don't get too excited, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,别爱上我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or...too attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是路过这儿罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm just rollin' through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.40,0:08:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,其实这话可以说得更好听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there's about a million other ways you could have said that.
