Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,在我的床上搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,还真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:08:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.15,0:09:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩开房去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a room, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,开过了  但被你俩玷污了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a room till you two soiled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.63,0:09:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,爱你哦  克劳利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,更爱你  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you more, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是安·玛丽  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne Marie, Jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,请穿裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,三局两胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,输家买酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losers buy the beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,买很多酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那姑娘不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl seemed nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,受过些伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slightly damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看得出以前的你有点为此动心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could see the old you falling for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她对我毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}She means nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.72,0:09:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是人过不留痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're rolling stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.97,0:09:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不能有牵挂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No distractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,守住  守住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock it down. Lock it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.87,0:09:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-闭嘴吧  -你要丢球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop talking. - You're bodging it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.91,0:09:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你就非得说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd shut up...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你老这么唠叨我都没法玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep talking... I can't play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们谈谈嘛  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we'll talk about it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.77,0:10:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么这么对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.72,0:10:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你得冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.73,0:10:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-你去哪了  -住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where were you? - Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.17,0:10:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is this him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是马特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, are you Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.11,0:10:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我滚得远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,再也别联系她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try and contact her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,连想都不要想她\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, don't even think about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,听懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:10:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉到了一丝尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sensing awkwardness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.69,0:11:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没有领袖了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...there's no... no leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在自我管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're governing yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.47,0:11:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,举行了很多重建  重组的会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's lot of meeting on rebuilding and reorganization...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,做了大量的和解\N{\fnArial\fs30}lots of reconciliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.81,0:11:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还在监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他的门已经永久封住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His door has been made permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为能早点见到你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've thought we'd see you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想早点去  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've come sooner but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.33,0:11:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.16,0:11:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven needs your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分坠落的天使都已经回到了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the angels who fell during the fall have returned to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还有少数没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有些是不肯回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some out-and-out refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.59,0:12:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,叛逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogues.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,其中两个杀了我们的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of them have killed one of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那个天使只是想带他们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}for only attempting to bring them back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.69,0:12:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.72,0:12:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼尔和阿迪娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel and Adina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.45,0:12:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,得找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们必须被带回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be brought home,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,并受到责罚  这是为了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they must be punished for the sake of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你能赶来  探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate you coming down, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们怕是浪费国家汽油了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm afraid you may have just cost uncle Sam a tank of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.86,0:12:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你是来调查德鲁·尼利的案子  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came up here to investigate Drew Neely's murder, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是  没人能确定那是桩凶杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem is, no one's certain it was a murder at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.12,0:12:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then what are we dealing with here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,自杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,应该说是自卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Self-defense, more likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,监控录像有点问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the surveillance footage was corrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:13:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的技术人员终于修复了文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our techies finally managed to clean up the file.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a sec now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,(黑马刺)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.86,0:13:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以按照你的意思来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this however you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别装作我下午没看着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't pretend I didn't see you this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你看清楚我的招式了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get a good look? You see my moves?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,希望如此  我正想找个厉害的练练拳脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so, 'cause I sure could use the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,盯住那个不明男子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That John Doe right there is the one you want to keep your eye on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.39,0:13:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.89,0:13:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些阿比顿的粉丝都一个样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all you Abaddon groupies are the Same, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你  还有在加油站袭击我的那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, the douche that jumped me at the gas station,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.77,0:13:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就是不肯接受女王已经驾崩  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just can't accept that the queen is dead, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.87,0:13:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我们不能接受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we just can't accept
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是杀了她的是你这样的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a douche like you was the one who killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.33,0:14:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  这真是不好受  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's got to hurt, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那个黄书男也没招谁惹谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now, porn guy's just minding his own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,德鲁·尼利来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's Drew Neely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看见刀了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这就算是伤人企图\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's intent right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.82,0:14:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是把短剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a cutlass or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.07,0:14:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道这算怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.97,0:14:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是  我不知道这人是好人还是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem is, we don't know if this guy's a hero or a psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这张图片已经上传通报了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the image that's getting uploaded to the wires.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,警探  你介意我  再仔细看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective, do you mind if I, uh, take another look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,自便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-我就回来  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you back in a few. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.09,0:16:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,传真  爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{*}Fax, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来的  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's it from, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没说  只有张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't say. There's a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.15,0:16:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,(没错)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道天使也会晕车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know angels could get nauseous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是需要缓缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.19,0:17:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,都怪我  我过弯道时再开快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fault. I'll take the curves faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.95,0:17:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好得不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:17:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.21,0:17:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你离开天堂后  你借来的能量就渐渐枯竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you left heaven, your borrowed grace was failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看来  你现在情况更糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the looks of you, you've only gotten worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你要死了  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dying, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要更多能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need more grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们有任务要执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have a mission in front of us
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我的需求  我们所有人的需求都得等等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that supersedes my needs... all of our needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.61,0:18:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好士兵  汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good soldier, Hannah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,最优秀的之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one of the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是你勇敢出手  梅塔特隆是绝不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron certainly could not have been brought to heel
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.57,0:18:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,被制服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}without your bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.43,0:18:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你也功不可没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你得照顾好自己  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must take care of yourself, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那么为了我活命  就该让别的天使死掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And another angel should die so that I can be saved?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这有那么难想通吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this really that hard to understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm feeling better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.23,0:19:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那个黄书男真不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Porn guy was an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那人突然就上去袭击他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro came at him like, "What?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他则淡定得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was all like, "Wh-a-a-at?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.07,0:19:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"叫我的名字  叫我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Say my name! Say my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.77,0:19:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我的名字"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say my name."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.83,0:19:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,流了好多血啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.89,0:19:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the guy, uh... when...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}When...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"黄书男"进来的时候  他说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Porn guy" came in, did he...say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.95,0:19:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"黄书在哪"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"W-where's the porn""
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.44,0:19:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就这句\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.98,0:19:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他买什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he buy anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.06,0:19:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他用信用卡了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he... did he use a credit card?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那么有个人走进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So some guy comes in,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.11,0:19:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在你店里  在你眼前杀了另一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}kills another guy in your store on your watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.41,0:19:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你就像没事人一样该咋咋地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you just... You what? Just keep on keepin' on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说那个黄书男把另一个人捅死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean when porn guy was stabbing the other guy to death
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.37,0:19:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他们就在我10英尺开外处\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 feet in front of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我都拉在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was having a total code-brown moment
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的裤子里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my favorite freakin' pants
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.01,0:20:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我以为接下来会是我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I thought I was next,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.87,0:20:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我有没有上去采访他一番吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did I conduct a field interview?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,能帮我个忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey. Uh, can you do me a solid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.75,0:20:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在货架下捡到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found this wedged under the T.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.19,0:20:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是那个死者的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's the dead guy's phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要回警局去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, if you're heading back to the station...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,(电子邮件: 老大 有任务给你)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.53,0:20:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,(温彻斯特  威斯康辛州  阿姆赫斯特  加油站  11点到12点  阿比顿万岁)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.75,0:20:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经死了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.01,0:20:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只是在用死人的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just using a dead man's phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,小鹿  你好久才找到我们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moose. Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.73,0:20:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你哥哥都寻思你是不是又撞狗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother and I were beginning to wonder if you'd hit another dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.82,0:20:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.31,0:20:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我哥哥死了  克劳利\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother is dead, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.81,0:21:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你找了个恶魔放进了他身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you have some freaking demon parading around in his meatsuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.61,0:21:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我  你会为此付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And trust me, you are gonna pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,小鹿  小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moose. Moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.97,0:21:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕你是梦想得不够大胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you haven't allowed yourself to dream quite big enough here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你哥哥生龙活虎呢  多亏了血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother is very much alive, courtesy of the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩体内唯一的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only demonized soul inside of Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.09,0:21:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}is his and his alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.75,0:21:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有点扭曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wee bit more twisted,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,毁坏得有点认不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little more mangled beyond human recognition,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但我可以向你保证  那是他自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, I can assure you, all his.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  感觉好点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, now. Feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还有  你不断派去杀我哥哥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the, uh, Abaddon supporters you've been sending
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.50,0:21:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,阿比顿追随者\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kill my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.03,0:21:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩被骗了是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}how does Dean feel about that double-cross?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.82,0:21:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,假如你以为是这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's what you think is happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那比我想的还不自量力\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you're more out of your depths than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how you did this,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.61,0:21:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你玩的是什么黑魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of... black-magic stunt you pulled,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.94,0:21:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但你给我听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but hear me --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我会救回我哥哥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will save my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,至死方休\N{\fnArial\fs30}or die trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.04,0:21:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道整件事最让我兴奋的地方在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what tickles me about all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.77,0:21:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就是真正让你受不了的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what's really eating you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不在乎他是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't care that he's a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.55,0:21:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你也当过恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heck, you've been a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.76,0:21:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都当过恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all been demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的  而是他和我在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's that he's with me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.03,0:22:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,而他开心得要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's having the time of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.13,0:22:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能接受的是  他现在属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stand the fact that he's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是你的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not your pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.70,0:22:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.91,0:22:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的死党\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my best friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.77,0:22:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的犯罪搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}my partner in crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,人们会为我们写赞歌  画漫画的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll write songs about us, graphic novels.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.63,0:22:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,, 《克劳力和松鼠的悲惨历险记》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Misadventures of Crowley and Squirrel".
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.83,0:22:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特让我完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester completes me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,正是这一点让你不淡定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's what makes you lose your chickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.97,0:22:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to find you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我会救回我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to save my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.65,0:22:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,然后  我要把你碎尸万段\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm going to kill you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.22,0:22:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这是行话  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the operative phrase, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"找到你"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Find you."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.09,0:22:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.79,0:22:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,(已定位)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.72,0:22:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,(北达科他州  比乌拉)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:22:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,(黑马刺  北达科他州  比乌拉  刀河路156号)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.48,0:23:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{*}Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.94,0:23:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你在钓什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you fishing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,主要是鳟鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trout, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.50,0:24:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,它们喜欢香喷喷的长卷尾蛆饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do love a good curlytail grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.02,0:24:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,窍门是找准急流外的那个特殊位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trick is to find that special spot just outside the run,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.93,0:24:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那些大鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the big ones --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.63,0:24:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,聪明的鱼在那儿藏身\N{\fnArial\fs30}the smart ones -- are holding low.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,它们...会挣扎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they -- do they put up much of a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.96,0:24:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说那些真正渴望自由的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones who truly want to be free?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.04,0:24:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,它们会抗争的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你是为了我们死去的兄弟而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here about our brother who died.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你很吃惊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that surprise you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.64,0:24:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以向你保证...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.62,0:24:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,假如他不来招惹我们  本不会有人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had he just left us alone, no one would've been harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.16,0:24:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他得到的命令是不能放任你们不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}His orders were to not leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.46,0:24:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.52,0:24:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,然后天堂又派了两个人下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And heaven sends two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.41,0:24:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们天使兄弟们怎么就是不明白呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it about us angels that we can't seem to get the message?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.51,0:24:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是你不明白吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it is you who has failed to get the message?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.23,0:24:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所有人都要服从天堂的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us serve at heaven's command.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.87,0:24:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我想是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.16,0:24:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但那是在大坠落之前  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was before the fall, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.99,0:25:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你是一名天使  永远都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are an angel, once and forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.05,0:25:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在不知情的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dropped unwillingly...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.69,0:25:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,被迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}unknowingly...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.76,0:25:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,坠落到一片陌生的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a strange land,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.82,0:25:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们发现  这是一片\N{\fnArial\fs30}a land that, as it turns out,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.24,0:25:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,崇尚自由  个体的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}celebrates the free, the individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.39,0:25:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是几千年来第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in thousands of years,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.86,0:25:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我有了选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.35,0:25:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,而随着每一次选择...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with each choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.49,0:25:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-我开始发掘真实的自我  -太胡扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I begin to discover who I really am. - This is nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.32,0:25:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为天堂没教过这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they don't teach you this in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.68,0:25:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他们该教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps they should.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.86,0:25:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就会明白这为什么值得为之斗争了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you would understand why it's worth fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.80,0:25:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他在嘲笑我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taunting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.55,0:25:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.91,0:25:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.74,0:25:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还是他杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he kills us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.85,0:25:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.92,0:25:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there is time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.98,0:25:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,继续听这些废话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hear more of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.43,0:25:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有时间劝他做正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}To convince him to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.16,0:25:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,而且  汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, Hannah,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.04,0:25:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还不知道另一个在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}we still don't even know where the other one is...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.78,0:25:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.93,0:26:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们得待到日落时分\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to stay for sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.80,0:26:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的夜晚令人醍醐灌顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nighttime around here is a revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.15,0:26:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是你派了那些恶魔来杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent those demons to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.85,0:26:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了让你保持警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep you sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.09,0:26:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.59,0:26:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是我派恶魔一路跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasn't for me throwing demon chum your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.68,0:26:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think would've happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.59,0:26:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,血印需要血祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark needs to be sated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.03,0:26:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-否则  -否则我就会变成恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Otherwise... - Otherwise, I turn into a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.38,0:26:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.63,0:26:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这点我六周前就明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sort of got that six weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.83,0:26:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.13,0:26:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.11,0:26:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think you're talking to here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.37,0:26:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,绿野仙踪里诚实的铁皮人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the tin man have a sheet-metal willy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.31,0:26:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然会骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.91,0:26:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.76,0:26:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.98,0:26:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,坐嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.91,0:26:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,为了咱们的未来  我必须让你振作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to keep you sharp for our future,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.94,0:26:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们还得聊聊未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}about which we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.62,0:26:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our future?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.45,0:26:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,职业方面的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our professional future.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.82,0:26:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.31,0:26:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要我再多忍受\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I have to spend one more night
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.04,0:26:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕一天你自怨自艾的情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this fetid petri dish of broken dreams and B.O.,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.12,0:27:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我都宁愿自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will cut off my own face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.45,0:27:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.35,0:27:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.26,0:27:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我好得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I'm great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.95,0:27:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.00,0:27:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你还能吃多少次"自杀式鸡翅挑战"\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many suicide wings can you eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.60,0:27:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你还要唱多少次卡拉OK\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many one-hit wonders can you karaoke to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.24,0:27:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  本来说好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, see, the deal was
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.07,0:27:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要对月嗥叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}we howl at the moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.97,0:27:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不分时间  永不停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time stamp, no expiration date.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.01,0:27:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经叫过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've howled.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.01,0:27:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,也吠过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've bayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.08,0:27:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,什么好玩的我们都玩过三遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-we've done extraordinary things to triplets,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.38,0:27:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都非常爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of which have been massively entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我会永远珍惜这段日子的网络相册\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will treasure our flickr albums forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.99,0:27:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可现在该接受我们的真实面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now it's time for us to accept what we are
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.92,0:27:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,回去工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.25,0:27:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.65,0:27:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.10,0:27:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱之王  有迪恩·温彻斯特相助\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king of hell, Dean Winchester by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.23,0:27:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起统治  一起创建完美的地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together we rule. Together we create the perfect hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.08,0:27:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之间萌生的友谊  永远不会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all of this that's bloomed between us never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并不是要结束狂欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not ending the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.86,0:27:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,只是换个地方继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just moving the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.58,0:28:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,离开小俱乐部  换成露天体育场巡演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out with the club circuit, in with the stadium tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.79,0:28:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是忘了说  我之前跟小鹿通过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I forget to mention I spoke to moose earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.78,0:28:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.12,0:28:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.12,0:28:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,显然  他追踪我们有一段日子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, he's been tracking us for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.66,0:28:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他从你捅死的那个恶魔的手机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got my text from the cell of that demon
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.08,0:28:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了我的短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you stabbed in blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.48,0:28:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.25,0:28:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们谈了心  感情涌动\N{\fnArial\fs30}words were spoken -- emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.56,0:28:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,回想一下  我意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize, in retrospect,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.14,0:28:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我们说了太多  情绪太激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps too many words, too many emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.49,0:28:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他追踪了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He traced the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.82,0:28:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.97,0:28:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜他最晚明早就会赶到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess he'll be here by morning -- the latest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.34,0:28:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你出卖了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.84,0:28:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.25,0:28:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's going on with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.73,0:28:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.77,0:28:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,可我真是受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've had just about enough of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.69,0:28:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,出卖你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.20,0:28:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,说"帮你个忙"比较合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try "doing you a favor."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.10,0:28:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,过去六个月我为你做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I've done for you for the past six months --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.86,0:28:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,血印  第一刃  让你复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mark, the First Blade, midwifing you back to life,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.65,0:29:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,让你做我的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}offering you a seat by my side --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.24,0:29:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,都是在帮你  是馈赠\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been a favor, a gift,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.15,0:29:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你明不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether you see it or you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.71,0:29:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.63,0:29:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,做出决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道哪能找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.40,0:30:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.76,0:30:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I -- I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.37,0:30:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,它突然罢工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just died on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.88,0:30:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-在这儿吗  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Out here? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.01,0:30:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你的车真是想和你对着干啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ride really has it out for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.22,0:30:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.21,0:30:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,要我帮你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give you a hand with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.76,0:30:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好  非常感谢  多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I'd appreciate it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.72,0:30:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这些靠计算机控制的新款车啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}These new cars and their computerized brains, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.41,0:30:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,放错一个零  整个都完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}One zero out of place, and the whole thing just goes kaput.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.62,0:30:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看那  问题就出在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, right there. There's your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.18,0:30:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.31,0:30:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是个制动开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a kill switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.61,0:30:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,遥控器在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This here is the remote.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.51,0:30:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你是右撇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guessing you're a righty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.05,0:31:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 虚幻的爱人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Imaginary lovers. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.33,0:31:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 不会拒绝你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Never turn you down. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-跑调了  -太难听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tone deaf! - Awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.73,0:31:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.78,0:31:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 当别人都弃你而去 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When all the others turn you away. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.32,0:31:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 她们还在你身边 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ They're around. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.66,0:31:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 这是我独有的快乐 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's my private pleasure. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.93,0:31:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 午夜幻想 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Midnight fantasy. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.24,0:31:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们真讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.37,0:32:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,喝吧  硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.34,0:32:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不用  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.05,0:32:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己作死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.36,0:32:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.03,0:32:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧  就我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go somewhere, you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.54,0:32:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就在外面呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.49,0:32:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.51,0:32:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,去别的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.04,0:32:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.63,0:32:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都不怎么认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}we barely know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.58,0:32:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你还喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.61,0:32:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.99,0:32:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我还维护过你呢  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I protected your honor, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.18,0:32:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  我本来也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I thought so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.04,0:32:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,看你揍马特  我还好开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing you take on Matt, I was like, "wow""
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.31,0:32:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,从没有人为我做这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever done that for me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.41,0:32:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不停地揍他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then you kept going and going,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.85,0:33:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我意识到不管你是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I realized whatever is going on with you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.96,0:33:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你绝不是为了维护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}has nothing to do with my "honor" at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.08,0:33:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,从一场酒吧斗殴里看出这么多来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got all that from a bar fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.18,0:33:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.28,0:33:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我在旅馆当服务员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wait tables at a roadhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.62,0:33:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我遇到过坏人  遇到过好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meet the bad guys. I meet the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.57,0:33:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,也许有那么一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe for a second there,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.84,0:33:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我还认为你是假装坏人的好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I though you were a good guy playing bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.25,0:33:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道  这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.84,0:33:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're just --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.80,0:33:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,开车经过每一个小镇破酒馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind of guy who sleeps with every skank
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.04,0:33:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,都会和镇上的骚娘们上床的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}in every small-town dive that he passes through?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.88,0:33:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真是会看人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you really do know how to read people,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.09,0:33:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这听起来就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that sure as hell sounds like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.94,0:33:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.76,0:33:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so screwed up myself
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.27,0:33:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我会离开这里  还心想是我活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna walk out of here thinking I actually deserved that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.23,0:34:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法理解的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'll never understand Is
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.33,0:34:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么天使不肯承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}why angels won't acknowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.91,0:34:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,人间的智慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wisdom to be found down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.38,0:34:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,人类能有什么智慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What wisdom is to be gained from humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.64,0:34:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是在跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not speaking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.53,0:34:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白他在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand what he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.80,0:34:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.71,0:34:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,即使你可以获得自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you are to be free,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.37,0:34:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,也得由所有天使来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is to be decided by all angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.19,0:34:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是天使的讽刺啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's that angelic irony.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.11,0:34:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.66,0:34:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.60,0:34:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,阿迪娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adina.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.04,0:34:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是汉娜和卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Hannah and Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.84,0:34:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,请收起天使之刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stow the blade, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.83,0:34:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她先收起她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she stows hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.52,0:34:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,汉娜  你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.87,0:34:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在监狱里是没有机会争取自由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never get a chance to argue our freedom from a prison cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.77,0:34:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们屠杀同类之前  就该想到这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've thought of that before slaughtering one of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.70,0:34:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不不  我们在谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. We were talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.23,0:34:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚刚有进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were getting somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.36,0:35:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-好了  各位  -你想要自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, everybody just -- - You want to be free?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.63,0:35:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊  随意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.85,0:35:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.88,0:35:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.85,0:35:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-不  -丹尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.56,0:35:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.36,0:35:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.71,0:35:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.79,0:35:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-必须抓住她  -汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to. - Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.14,0:35:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.81,0:35:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.37,0:36:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  甜蜜的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Home, sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.30,0:36:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.93,0:36:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.64,0:36:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧  搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good, partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.69,0:36:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你的小胳膊还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that chicken wing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.85,0:36:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.60,0:36:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次弄伤胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time I broke my arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.74,0:36:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我哥哥戴维\N{\fnArial\fs30}my older brother, Davey,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.97,0:36:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,让我坐在他三速档自行车的把手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}had me riding on the handles of his three-speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.16,0:36:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,做了个前轮离地的动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decided to pop us a wheelie,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.74,0:36:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,想在DQ门外的小妞面前耍耍帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}look real fancy for all the little pretties outside the DQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.89,0:36:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是帅了一小会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we were looking mighty good for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.65,0:36:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,然后一声惊叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, "Whoop"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.59,0:36:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,火烧屁股了\N{\fnArial\fs30}ass end over teakettle, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.80,0:37:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,疼得要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurt like a son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.81,0:37:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你是萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.10,0:37:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我想这点我们都能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we both can agree on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.44,0:37:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而你的哥哥迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your older brother, Dean, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.48,0:37:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他和我  是老相识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He and I, we go way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.93,0:37:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你是猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.17,0:37:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.77,0:37:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we can go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.77,0:37:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,猎杀你哥哥也算是猎人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting your brother counts, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.67,0:37:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的话  就不那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.98,0:37:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-是啊  -相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.38,0:37:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  老兄  我不知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, buddy, I-I don't know who you are, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.03,0:37:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你想要什么或者我哥哥做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't what you want or what my brother did,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.50,0:37:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你还有理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you got any sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.20,0:37:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我建议你快逃走  逃回那个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you turn tail and run back to that
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.62,0:37:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你从上面走下来的征兵广告\N{\fnArial\fs30}army recruiting ad that spit you out in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.33,0:37:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.89,0:37:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.38,0:37:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.24,0:38:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很久很久以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many, many moons ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.58,0:38:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在  他是猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now he's prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.60,0:38:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我是猛兽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm the monster now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.78,0:38:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得上报这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{*}We have to report this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.51,0:38:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.31,0:38:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,事情失去了控制吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things got out of control?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.27,0:38:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,又一个天使死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another angel has died.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.09,0:38:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他想杀我  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was going to kill me, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.55,0:38:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只是不想被打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just wanted to be left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.94,0:38:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没有规矩  就会混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without rules, there is chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.40,0:38:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,混乱之中会产生像娜奥米  巴塞洛缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of chaos rise angels like Naomi,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.47,0:38:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.10,0:38:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还有梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.09,0:39:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,也许  我在这下面和他们待在一起太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, perhaps I've been down here with them for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.11,0:39:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这世界似乎只有混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's seemingly nothing but chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.99,0:39:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但混乱并不只产生邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not all bad comes from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.92,0:39:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Art.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.74,0:39:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.94,0:39:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.16,0:39:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.39,0:39:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但那些都是人类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But t-those are human things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.35,0:39:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.71,0:39:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,(萨姆来电)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.90,0:39:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,酒吧的钱付了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left you an open tab at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.21,0:39:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你尽管喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.27,0:39:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能还真会接受你的邀请呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hell, I just may take you up on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.38,0:39:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.55,0:40:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.04,0:40:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我是报应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm karma, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.60,0:40:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着我弟弟的电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my brother's phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.83,0:40:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着你弟弟的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your brother's phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.80,0:40:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.25,0:40:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.04,0:40:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你去我指定的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as long as you show up where I tell you to show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.07,0:40:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你弟弟就不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}your brother will be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.23,0:40:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么确定他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do I know he's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.77,0:40:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.11,0:40:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proof of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.50,0:40:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.01,0:40:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有笔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.94,0:40:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.34,0:40:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没有交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.77,0:40:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没有见面  什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no meet-up. There's no nothing --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.79,0:40:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我百分之百地保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except the 100% guarantee that,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.62,0:40:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}somewhere down the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.49,0:40:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我会找到你  我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will find you, and I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.64,0:40:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那对你死了的弟弟可起不了安慰作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that'll be cold comfort to your dead brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.90,0:40:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我都叫他放我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him to let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.28,0:40:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他现在陷入的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever jam he's in now,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.87,0:41:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就只是他的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is his problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.63,0:41:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  我割开他喉咙时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I'll be sure to pass that on to him
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.42,0:41:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会转告他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I'm slitting his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.26,0:41:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好  你请便  因为他了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you do that, 'cause he knows me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.90,0:41:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他也完全了解  如果说我有什么特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he knows damn sure that if I am one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.66,0:41:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是信守承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a man of my word.

